tinacloud-org(1) -- Interact with TinaCloud organisations
==========================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud org` <command>

## DESCRIPTION

View organisations available to the signed-in TinaCloud user.

## COMMANDS

  * `list`:
    List organisations.

## EXAMPLES

List the organisations available to the signed-in account:

	$ tinacloud org list

Print the result as JSON:

	$ tinacloud org list --json

